{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778976092222,"sessionID":"ses_1ccc97848ffe0WlvSbtl03avaE","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_ElaFnCjzvWA0bhrAuIQAKSfI","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n+Changes committed in PR #<NN>.\n*** Add File: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n+Addresses issue #3536 by adding epithelial shape axiomatization for squamous and cuboidal epithelial cells.\n+\n+Changes made:\n+\n+- Added new term `cuboidal epithelial cell` (`CL_9900000`) with definition, issue tracker link, creation date, creator, and logical definition as `epithelial cell` and `has characteristic` some `cuboid` (`PATO:0001872`).\n+- Updated `squamous epithelial cell` (`CL_0000076`) with a textual definition and logical definition as `epithelial cell` and `has characteristic` some `flattened` (`PATO:0002254`).\n+- Added direct `has characteristic` shape restrictions to selected squamous and cuboidal epithelial cell terms whose labels or definitions explicitly state these shapes.\n+- Linked selected cuboidal epithelial descendants to the new `cuboidal epithelial cell` parent where appropriate.\n+- Added `epithelial cell` as a stated parent for `salivary gland glandular cell` so the cuboidal salivary duct descendant has an explicit epithelial lineage.\n+- Extended `docs/relations_guide.md` with guidance for recording epithelial cell shape using `has characteristic` and PATO terms.\n+\n+Rationale:\n+\n+- The issue requested making squamous and cuboidal epithelial shapes explicit in logical definitions and in stated restrictions for relevant terms.\n+- `PATO:0002254` (`flattened`) and `PATO:0001872` (`cuboid`, synonym cuboidal) were checked in OLS before use.\n+- The requested DOSDP files under `src/patterns` were not added because the local repository instructions restrict edits to `src/ontology/cl-edit.owl` and `docs/`.\n+\n+Validation:\n+\n+- Ran `robot convert -i src/ontology/cl-edit.owl -o /tmp/opencode/cl-edit-test.owl` successfully.\n+- Ran `git diff --check -- src/ontology/cl-edit.owl docs/relations_guide.md` successfully.\n+\n+Checklist completed:\n+\n+- Checked existing epithelial terms and shape axioms.\n+- Checked proposed parent terms for consistency.\n+- Added ontology axioms for squamous and cuboidal epithelial shape patterns.\n+- Updated documentation for epithelial shape characteristics.\n+- Validated ontology syntax.\n+\n+Signed-off-by: GitHub Copilot\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\nA PR_COMMENTS.md","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,1 @@\n+Changes committed in PR #<NN>.\n\nIndex: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,31 @@\n+Addresses issue #3536 by adding epithelial shape axiomatization for squamous and cuboidal epithelial cells.\n+\n+Changes made:\n+\n+- Added new term `cuboidal epithelial cell` (`CL_9900000`) with definition, issue tracker link, creation date, creator, and logical definition as `epithelial cell` and `has characteristic` some `cuboid` (`PATO:0001872`).\n+- Updated `squamous epithelial cell` (`CL_0000076`) with a textual definition and logical definition as `epithelial cell` and `has characteristic` some `flattened` (`PATO:0002254`).\n+- Added direct `has characteristic` shape restrictions to selected squamous and cuboidal epithelial cell terms whose labels or definitions explicitly state these shapes.\n+- Linked selected cuboidal epithelial descendants to the new `cuboidal epithelial cell` parent where appropriate.\n+- Added `epithelial cell` as a stated parent for `salivary gland glandular cell` so the cuboidal salivary duct descendant has an explicit epithelial lineage.\n+- Extended `docs/relations_guide.md` with guidance for recording epithelial cell shape using `has characteristic` and PATO terms.\n+\n+Rationale:\n+\n+- The issue requested making squamous and cuboidal epithelial shapes explicit in logical definitions and in stated restrictions for relevant terms.\n+- `PATO:0002254` (`flattened`) and `PATO:0001872` (`cuboid`, synonym cuboidal) were checked in OLS before use.\n+- The requested DOSDP files under `src/patterns` were not added because the local repository instructions restrict edits to `src/ontology/cl-edit.owl` and `docs/`.\n+\n+Validation:\n+\n+- Ran `robot convert -i src/ontology/cl-edit.owl -o /tmp/opencode/cl-edit-test.owl` successfully.\n+- Ran `git diff --check -- src/ontology/cl-edit.owl docs/relations_guide.md` successfully.\n+\n+Checklist completed:\n+\n+- Checked existing epithelial terms and shape axioms.\n+- Checked proposed parent terms for consistency.\n+- Added ontology axioms for squamous and cuboidal epithelial shape patterns.\n+- Updated documentation for epithelial shape characteristics.\n+- Validated ontology syntax.\n+\n+Signed-off-by: GitHub Copilot\n\n","files":[{"filePath":"/__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md","relativePath":"ISSUE_COMMENTS.md","type":"add","patch":"Index: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,1 @@\n+Changes committed in PR #<NN>.\n","additions":1,"deletions":0},{"filePath":"/__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md","relativePath":"PR_COMMENTS.md","type":"add","patch":"Inde